					<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Home]]></title>
		<link>http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/</link>
		<pubDate>Mon, 25 Sep 2017 14:10:49 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[di-business]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/?page_id=2</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>Design Your wordpress</h2>		
			<p>Get complete control over the design of your WordPress site in a matter of minutes. Go from draft to website in less time than ever before.</p>		
			<a href="https://dithemes.com/product/di-business-pro-wordpress-theme/" target="_blank" role="button">
						Get It
					</a>
				<figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/zusman-nft5lzntm0m9rmcm5nrq9h5u26fsxzzdncs6caendo.png" alt="zusman.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/zing-nft5lzntm0m9rmcm5nrq9h5u26fsxzzdncs6caendo.png" alt="zing.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/madrin-nft5b1tg2fn4n08p1fj1qqjp5qd0ctjuh7fq9cmlss.png" alt="madrin.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/armond-1-nft5lzntm0m9rmcm5nrq9h5u26fsxzzdncs6caendo.png" alt="armond-1.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/x.venox_-nft5b1tg2fn4n08p1fj1qqjp5qd0ctjuh7fq9cmlss.png" alt="x.venox_.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/geo-nft5b1tg2fn4n08p1fj1qqjp5qd0ctjuh7fq9cmlss.png" alt="geo.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/fifthflour-nft5m0lnsunk38b9066ctyxankb65p33zhfntkd97g.png" alt="fifthflour.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/larozse-nft5m0lnsunk38b9066ctyxankb65p33zhfntkd97g.png" alt="larozse.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/bolier-nft5m0lnsunk38b9066ctyxankb65p33zhfntkd97g.png" alt="bolier.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/mapmaster-nft5b1tg2fn4n08p1fj1qqjp5qd0ctjuh7fq9cmlss.png" alt="mapmaster.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/darkside-nft5m0lnsunk38b9066ctyxankb65p33zhfntkd97g.png" alt="darkside.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/digit-nft5b1tg2fn4n08p1fj1qqjp5qd0ctjuh7fq9cmlss.png" alt="digit.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/col-nft5m0lnsunk38b9066ctyxankb65p33zhfntkd97g.png" alt="col.png" /></figure>			
							"What really turned me over was the ability to understand how everything works without any prior knowledge."
							<img width="300" height="300" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25497478040_140ce47f31_k.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25497478040_140ce47f31_k.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25497478040_140ce47f31_k-100x100.jpg 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25497478040_140ce47f31_k-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25497478040_140ce47f31_k-90x90.jpg 90w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" />						
													John Doe
																			Designer
			<h3>Experience design at scale
</h3>		
