										<img width="400" height="400" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/3-3.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/3-3.jpg 400w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/3-3-300x300.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/3-3-100x100.jpg 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/3-3-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/3-3-90x90.jpg 90w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" />											
			<h2>Andrew michaels</h2>		
		<p>Andrew holds a Certified Elder Law Attorney (CELA) degree, and has over 18 years of experience as a prosecutor in New York State. Andrew has personally handled quite a few high-profile cases, both as prosecutor as well as a defense lawyer. He has represented over 100 New York firms in various litigations, an has only lost once, throughout his entire career. It wasn't his fault, the guy was clearly guilty.</p><p> </p>		
							<a href="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Facebook
									</a>
							<a href="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Twitter
									</a>
							<a href="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Google-plus
									</a>
							<a href="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Linkedin
									</a>
			<h3>Robert Jeffries</h3>		
		<p>Robert might look like a sweet old man, but when he puts on the famous litigation suit, he becomes a cunning lion. You really want a guy like Robert on your team. Finding loop holes and loose ends is what has made Robert famous in the New York district and beyond as one of the shrudest, most highly skilled lawyer in the business. Don't miss his closing arguments, they have never failed.</p>		
