					<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Restaurant]]></title>
		<link>http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/restaurant/</link>
		<pubDate>Thu, 12 Oct 2017 10:09:30 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[di-business]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/?page_id=348</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<img width="300" height="300" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Untitled-6-300x300.png" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Untitled-6-300x300.png 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Untitled-6-150x150.png 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Untitled-6-768x768.png 768w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Untitled-6-90x90.png 90w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Untitled-6-600x600.png 600w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Untitled-6-100x100.png 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/Untitled-6.png 900w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" />											
										<img width="433" height="600" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-hotel-wordpress-theme-demo.png" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-hotel-wordpress-theme-demo.png 433w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-hotel-wordpress-theme-demo-217x300.png 217w" sizes="(max-width: 433px) 100vw, 433px" />											
				<h3>
					Tea Cafe
				</h3>
								<p>Very first pocket friendly Tea Cafe running on solar energy. Please visit with your family and friends to have some sips and snacks with good music</p>
				<h3>
					Good Staff
				</h3>
								<p>Click edit button to change this text. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>
				<h3>
					Yummy Food 
				</h3>
								<p>One of the best Italian restaurant in town. From the time you’ll enter till the time you’re there you’ll feel piece within</p>
				<h3>
					Good Place Service
				</h3>
								<p>Click edit button to change this text. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>
			<h1>Foods For You</h1>		
						<i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i><i>&#xE934;</i> 5/5		
			<h4>Samosa</h4>		
							<figure>
										<img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/indian-spicy-vegetable-samosa-ohbvtzn3nc5x9z9xipbbx3zzj50wo5cfrein1lxjl8.jpg" title="indian-spicy-vegetable-samosa.jpg" alt="indian-spicy-vegetable-samosa.jpg" />											<figcaption>Price:- $250</figcaption>
										</figure>
			<h4>Pork Rillette</h4>		
							<figure>
										<img width="620" height="387" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/restaurant_2999753b.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/restaurant_2999753b.jpg 620w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/restaurant_2999753b-300x187.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/restaurant_2999753b-600x375.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 620px) 100vw, 620px" />											<figcaption>Price:- $500</figcaption>
										</figure>
			<h4>Burger</h4>		
							<figure>
										<img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/1556650985490-ohbvu0kxu676krdcnesc28yy3tz2bjulyuw8f8kegq.jpeg" title="1556650985490.jpeg" alt="1556650985490.jpeg" />											<figcaption>Price:- $900</figcaption>
										</figure>
			<h4>Charcuterie</h4>		
							<figure>
										<img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/foodiesfeed-ohdlcfn0k7kla6o6pwq04axoyeb6pkjavvvd1ajwq4.jpg" title="foodiesfeed" alt="foodiesfeed" />											<figcaption>Price:- $700</figcaption>
										</figure>
			<h4>Sahi Paneer</h4>		
							<figure>
										<img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/foodiesfeed.com_homemade-pizza-ohbvu2gm7u9s8t5u28j7mladban0b8nmrsh3hftd2k.jpg" title="foodiesfeed.com_homemade-pizza.jpg" alt="foodiesfeed.com_homemade-pizza.jpg" />											<figcaption>Price:- $1200</figcaption>
										</figure>
			<a href="#" role="button">
						More Food
					</a>
			<h2>Our Sweets</h2>		
		<p>Handcrafted delights that instantly brighten up your day. Whether its chocolate, vanilla or cinnamon, we use the finest ingredients to produce these mouth watering artifacts.</p>		
			<figure class='gallery-item'>
				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox="default" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="247bd3ce" href='http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_Your-Sunny-Side-Up-2.jpg'><img width="150" height="150" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_Your-Sunny-Side-Up-2-150x150.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_Your-Sunny-Side-Up-2-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_Your-Sunny-Side-Up-2-90x90.jpg 90w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_Your-Sunny-Side-Up-2-300x300.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_Your-Sunny-Side-Up-2-100x100.jpg 100w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></a>
			</figure><figure class='gallery-item'>
				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox="default" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="247bd3ce" href='http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_traditional-czech-honey-cake-caffee-latte.jpg'><img width="150" height="150" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_traditional-czech-honey-cake-caffee-latte-150x150.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_traditional-czech-honey-cake-caffee-latte-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_traditional-czech-honey-cake-caffee-latte-90x90.jpg 90w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_traditional-czech-honey-cake-caffee-latte-300x300.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_traditional-czech-honey-cake-caffee-latte-100x100.jpg 100w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></a>
			</figure><figure class='gallery-item'>
				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox="default" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="247bd3ce" href='http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/fooodiesfeed.com_sweet-and-salty-brunch.jpg'><img width="150" height="150" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/fooodiesfeed.com_sweet-and-salty-brunch-150x150.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/fooodiesfeed.com_sweet-and-salty-brunch-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/fooodiesfeed.com_sweet-and-salty-brunch-300x300.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/fooodiesfeed.com_sweet-and-salty-brunch-768x767.jpg 768w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/fooodiesfeed.com_sweet-and-salty-brunch-90x90.jpg 90w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/fooodiesfeed.com_sweet-and-salty-brunch-600x599.jpg 600w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/fooodiesfeed.com_sweet-and-salty-brunch-100x100.jpg 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/fooodiesfeed.com_sweet-and-salty-brunch.jpg 1024w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></a>
			</figure><figure class='gallery-item'>
				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox="default" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="247bd3ce" href='http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_homemade-pizza.jpg'><img width="150" height="150" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_homemade-pizza-150x150.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_homemade-pizza-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_homemade-pizza-90x90.jpg 90w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_homemade-pizza-300x300.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/foodiesfeed.com_homemade-pizza-100x100.jpg 100w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" /></a>
			</figure><figure class='gallery-item'>
