			<h2>“Tasty food, set inside a lovely coffee house.”</h2>		
							It was an real incredible experience for me. The quality of food was only matched by the quality of service I got. I wish I can keep the flavor in my mouth for ever. Thanks for making the evening an unforgettable one.
							<img width="291" height="291" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/25388788904_72d2f5ec6f_z.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/25388788904_72d2f5ec6f_z.jpg 291w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/25388788904_72d2f5ec6f_z-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/25388788904_72d2f5ec6f_z-90x90.jpg 90w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/25388788904_72d2f5ec6f_z-100x100.jpg 100w" sizes="(max-width: 291px) 100vw, 291px" />						
													Sandra Files
