			</figure><figure class='gallery-item'>
				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox="default" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="0403e53" href='http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/project-img2.jpg'><img width="500" height="360" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/project-img2.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/project-img2.jpg 500w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/project-img2-300x216.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></a>
			</figure><figure class='gallery-item'>
				<a data-elementor-open-lightbox="default" data-elementor-lightbox-slideshow="0403e53" href='http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/project-img4.jpg'><img width="500" height="360" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/project-img4.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/project-img4.jpg 500w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/project-img4-300x216.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px" /></a>
			</figure>
			<h3>our teaching team</h3>		
										<img width="166" height="165" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/teacther1.png" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/teacther1.png 166w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/teacther1-100x100.png 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/teacther1-150x150.png 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/teacther1-90x90.png 90w" sizes="(max-width: 166px) 100vw, 166px" />											
			<h2>Stella Lindley</h2>		
			<h2>ui/ux web master</h2>		
		<p>A strict teacher that has been teaching since the age of 16. Stella won't give you any slack, so you will have to do the very best work you've done in your life.</p>		
							<a href="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Facebook-f
									</a>
							<a href="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Twitter
									</a>
							<a href="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Google-plus-g
									</a>
										<img width="162" height="165" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/teacher2.jpg" alt="" />											
			<h2>Donald Martin</h2>		
			<h2> Computer Science</h2>		
		<p>Donald has a PHD in both Computer Science and Design. His beginner course is a must see for any aspiring web professional who want to learn from the best.</p>		
							<a href="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Facebook
									</a>
							<a href="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Twitter
									</a>
							<a href="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Google-plus
									</a>
										<img width="162" height="165" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/teacher3.jpg" alt="" />											
			<h2>Gaby Williams</h2>		
			<h2>AI Expert</h2>		
		<p>If there's someone who can explain anything, Gaby is the one. She teaches you not just how to do something, but why to do it this way and not the other.</p>		
							<a href="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Facebook
									</a>
							<a href="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Twitter
									</a>
							<a href="" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
					Google-plus
									</a>
										<img width="570" height="498" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/study-box_1.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/study-box_1.jpg 570w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/study-box_1-300x262.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px" />											
			<h3>Practice makes perfect</h3>		
		<p>We know about your hectic schedule. We also know the only way you truly understand a subject is by practicing it in a real environment. This is why we've set a playground area that's full of hours of exercises, questions and challenges. It even has a gaming section. </p>		
			<h3>The best campus facilities</h3>		
		<p>In addition to our online classroom, we also offer an option to take part in a live classroom. It takes place in our vast campus located in Westfield, London. Here you'll be able to use the most up-to-date facilities and computer equipment.</p>		
										<img width="570" height="498" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/library.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/library.jpg 570w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/library-300x262.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px" />											
			<h2>Learn from the very best</h2>		
		<p>Join our course and start building the most wanted career available today. We make sure every class is easily understood, and that all students reach the same level of expertise needed for today's hi-tech industry.</p>		
				<h3>
					Working hours
				</h3>
								<p>Monday- Thursday:8:00-18:30 Hrs <br>(Phone until 17:30 Hrs)<br>Friday - 8:00-14:00</p>
				<h3>
					We are here
				</h3>
								<p>Westfield London 2039-2041 Westfield <br>Phone:+44 20 8834 4688 <br>Fax:+44 20 8859 6598 <br>Email: info@collage.com</p>
			<iframe frameborder="0" scrolling="no" marginheight="0" marginwidth="0" src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=London%20Eye%2C%20London%2C%20United%20Kingdom&amp;t=m&amp;z=10&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=near" aria-label="London Eye, London, United Kingdom"></iframe>]]></content:encoded>
