		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h1>brookstroks</h1>		
			<h2>manhattan</h2>		
			<h3>Our vision</h3>		
		<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Suspendisse a libero et diam rhoncus mollis. Donec non arcu elit. Nam consequat, elit nec efficitur elementum, tellus tellus pharetra ante.</p>		
			<a href="#" role="button">
						learn more
					</a>
										<img width="730" height="524" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Untitled-1.png" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Untitled-1.png 808w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Untitled-1-600x431.png 600w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Untitled-1-300x215.png 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Untitled-1-768x551.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 730px) 100vw, 730px" />											
				<h3>
					352
				</h3>
				<p>Approved projects </p>
				<h3>
					120
				</h3>
				<p>Returning customers </p>
				<h3>
					17
				</h3>
				<p>Award nomination </p>
				<h3>
					23
				</h3>
				<p>Years of experience</p>
			<h3>About Us</h3>		
		<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Suspendisse a libero et diam rhoncus mollis. Donec non arcu elit. Nam consequat, elit nec efficitur elementum, tellus tellus pharetra ante, nec hendrerit risus metus sed metus. Sed egestas, urna eu posuere pretium, mauris augue aliquam lectus, vitae iaculis odio nunc </p>		
			<a href="#" role="button">
						learn more
					</a>
				<h3>
					“
				</h3>
				<p>A doctor can bury his mistakes, but an architect can only advise his clients to plant vines.” </p>
		<p style="text-align: center;">Frank Lloyd Wright</p>		
			<h4>Contact us</h4>		
		<p>Leave us a note and we will get back to you for a free consultation</p>		
					<ul>
							<li >
										+986-99-8885
									</li>
								<li >
										noreply@gmail.com
									</li>
								<li >
										16 Church Ave, Brooklyn, NY 11226
									</li>
						</ul>
				<figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Nano-nft5rsbz5b5pk1un3pjbkz2zf1rh2xdxi5bdt0kmzs.png" alt="Nano.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Physiocare.-nft5rsbz5b5pk1un3pjbkz2zf1rh2xdxi5bdt0kmzs.png" alt="Physiocare..png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Edgewater.-nft5rt9tc56zvnt9y7xy5gug0fmuamhnu9yvaaj8tk.png" alt="Edgewater..png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Modal.-nft5rt9tc56zvnt9y7xy5gug0fmuamhnu9yvaaj8tk.png" alt="Modal..png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Liès-Luisa-García-nft5rt9tc56zvnt9y7xy5gug0fmuamhnu9yvaaj8tk.png" alt="Liès-Luisa-García.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Lobster.-nft5rt9tc56zvnt9y7xy5gug0fmuamhnu9yvaaj8tk.png" alt="Lobster..png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Me.-nft5rt9tc56zvnt9y7xy5gug0fmuamhnu9yvaaj8tk.png" alt="Me..png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Parisian.-nft5rt9tc56zvnt9y7xy5gug0fmuamhnu9yvaaj8tk.png" alt="Parisian..png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/Manaslu-nft5rt9tc56zvnt9y7xy5gug0fmuamhnu9yvaaj8tk.png" alt="Manaslu.png" /></figure>]]></content:encoded>
