					<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Mobile App]]></title>
		<link>http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/mobile-app/</link>
		<pubDate>Thu, 12 Oct 2017 10:25:19 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[di-business]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/?page_id=500</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>Drag. Drop. Design.</h2>		
		<p>Our one mission is to enable designers from around the world to be able to design interfaces in a much easier way.</p>		
			<a href="#" role="button">
						AppStore
					</a>
			<a href="#" role="button">
						AppStore
					</a>
			<a href="#" role="button">
						AppStore
					</a>
			<a href="#" role="button">
						AppStore
					</a>
										<img width="410" height="800" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/iPhone1.png" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/iPhone1.png 410w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/iPhone1-154x300.png 154w" sizes="(max-width: 410px) 100vw, 410px" />											
			<h2>Why Conoco?</h2>		
				<h3>
					Design it on the road
				</h3>
				<p>Click edit button to change this text. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>
				<h3>
					Fit for your corporate needs
				</h3>
				<p>Click edit button to change this text. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>
				<h3>
					Conoco works so you can rest
				</h3>
				<p>Click edit button to change this text. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>
				<h3>
