		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/?page_id=538</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<img width="75" height="72" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/flower31.png" alt="" />											
			<h4>The wedding celebration of</h4>		
			<h2>Lorena & Steven</h2>		
			<a href="#" role="button">
						December 17, 2019
					</a>
			<figure><img width="75" height="72" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/flower31.png" alt="" /></figure><h3>the bride</h3><p>Lorena Tayler</p>		
		<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Proin tempor justo sed quam luctus, nec semper lectus iaculis. Nulla a mattis nunc. Nullam rhoncus dui eget erat aliquam, quis sagittis ipsum lacinia. Ut molestie faucibus lacinia. Ut fringilla porttitor dolor, nec vestibulum tortor tempor in. Donec dictum ipsum vel urna facilisis, a finibus turpis eleifend. Phasellus gravida nisl in sagittis molestie. Phasellus sit amet est tristique, tristique augue ut, tincidunt ex. Donec vitae nulla nec mi gravida vestibulum. </p>		
										<img width="510" height="496" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bride.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bride.jpg 510w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bride-300x292.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px" />											
			<figure><img width="75" height="72" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/flower31.png" alt="" /></figure><h3>the groom</h3><p>Steven Kudrow</p>		
		<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Proin tempor justo sed quam luctus, nec semper lectus iaculis. Nulla a mattis nunc. Nullam rhoncus dui eget erat aliquam, quis sagittis ipsum lacinia. Ut molestie faucibus lacinia. Ut fringilla porttitor dolor, nec vestibulum tortor tempor in. Donec dictum ipsum vel urna facilisis, a finibus turpis eleifend. Phasellus gravida nisl in sagittis molestie. Phasellus sit amet est tristique, tristique augue ut, tincidunt ex. Donec vitae nulla nec mi gravida vestibulum. </p>		
										<img width="510" height="496" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groom-1.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groom-1.jpg 510w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groom-1-300x292.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 510px) 100vw, 510px" />											
			<h3>"To love is nothing. To be loved is something. But to love and be loved, that’s everything."</h3>		
			<h4>T. Tolis</h4>		
										<img width="75" height="72" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/flower31.png" alt="" />											
			<h3>the best men</h3>		
			<h4>Look at these handsome fellas</h4>		
							<figure>
										<img width="233" height="234" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman1.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman1.jpg 233w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman1-100x100.jpg 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman1-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman1-90x90.jpg 90w" sizes="(max-width: 233px) 100vw, 233px" />											<figcaption>Jhon Donald</figcaption>
										</figure>
							<figure>
										<img width="233" height="234" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman2.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman2.jpg 233w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman2-100x100.jpg 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman2-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman2-90x90.jpg 90w" sizes="(max-width: 233px) 100vw, 233px" />											<figcaption>Danny Goldman</figcaption>
										</figure>
							<figure>
										<img width="234" height="234" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman3.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman3.jpg 234w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman3-100x100.jpg 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman3-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman3-90x90.jpg 90w" sizes="(max-width: 234px) 100vw, 234px" />											<figcaption>Rick Mcqueen</figcaption>
										</figure>
							<figure>
										<img width="233" height="234" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman4.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman4.jpg 233w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman4-100x100.jpg 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman4-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/groomsman4-90x90.jpg 90w" sizes="(max-width: 233px) 100vw, 233px" />											<figcaption>Sean Morse</figcaption>
										</figure>
										<img width="75" height="72" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/flower31.png" alt="" />											
			<h3>Bridesmaids</h3>		
			<h4>The gorgeous group of gals</h4>		
							<figure>
										<img width="233" height="233" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Bridesmaids0Dbridsmade1.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Bridesmaids0Dbridsmade1.jpg 233w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Bridesmaids0Dbridsmade1-100x100.jpg 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Bridesmaids0Dbridsmade1-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/Bridesmaids0Dbridsmade1-90x90.jpg 90w" sizes="(max-width: 233px) 100vw, 233px" />											<figcaption>Mary Edelstein</figcaption>
										</figure>
							<figure>
										<img width="234" height="233" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade2.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade2.jpg 234w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade2-100x100.jpg 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade2-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade2-90x90.jpg 90w" sizes="(max-width: 234px) 100vw, 234px" />											<figcaption>Jane Montgomery</figcaption>
										</figure>
							<figure>
										<img width="234" height="233" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade3.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade3.jpg 234w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade3-100x100.jpg 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade3-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade3-90x90.jpg 90w" sizes="(max-width: 234px) 100vw, 234px" />											<figcaption>Lucy Seymour</figcaption>
										</figure>
							<figure>
										<img width="235" height="233" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade4.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade4.jpg 235w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade4-100x100.jpg 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade4-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bridsmade4-90x90.jpg 90w" sizes="(max-width: 235px) 100vw, 235px" />											<figcaption>Kate Cowell</figcaption>
										</figure>
			<h3>Wedding weekend itinerary</h3>		
			<h3>Rehearsal</h3>		
			<h3>Date</h3><p>December 17, 2019</p>		
			<figure><img width="75" height="72" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/flower31.png" alt="" /></figure><h3>Schedule</h3><p>From 18:00 PM</p>		
			<figure><img width="75" height="72" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/flower31.png" alt="" /></figure><h3>Venue</h3><p>3355, Wayside Lane, nakland, CA 94601</p>		
			<h3>Brunch</h3>		
			<h3>Date</h3><p>December 19, 2019</p>		
			<figure><img width="75" height="72" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/flower31.png" alt="" /></figure><h3>Schedule</h3><p>From 10:00 AM</p>		
			<figure><img width="75" height="72" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/flower31.png" alt="" /></figure><h3>Venue</h3><p>3355, Wayside Lane, nakland, CA 94601</p>		
			<h2>Ceremony & Reception</h2>		
			<h2>FRIDAY, OCTOBER 21, 2017 </h2>		
			<h2>2:30 PM – 5:30 PM</h2>		
			<h2>Marina Village Mojo Room </h2>		
			<h2>1936 Quivira Way – San Diego, California 92109
</h2>		
										<img width="75" height="72" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2018/06/flower31.png" alt="" />											
			<h3>Are you attending?</h3>		
			<h4>Please RSVP Before April 1th</h4>		
			<a href="#" role="button">
						I'll be there
					</a>]]></content:encoded>
