					<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Tourism]]></title>
		<link>http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/tourism/</link>
		<pubDate>Thu, 12 Oct 2017 10:33:36 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[di-business]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/?page_id=575</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>
					BikeTour
				</p>
				<p></p>
			<h2>Join our nature & urban bicycle adventures</h2>		
			<p>BikeTour offers the most interactive activity you can experience in urban and natural surroundings. Find out how the real city comes alive when you are guided by the right person</p>		
			<a href="#" role="button">
						join the next tour
					</a>
			<figure><img width="1024" height="640" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle1.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle1.jpg 1024w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle1-600x375.jpg 600w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle1-300x188.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle1-768x480.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure><h3>Get to know the real city</h3><p>Go into the places only locals are familiar with. Visit little known hideouts and avenues that open the mind into what being a local is all about.</p>		
			<figure><img width="1024" height="640" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle2.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle2.jpg 1024w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle2-600x375.jpg 600w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle2-300x188.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle2-768x480.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure><h3>Go off the beaten track</h3><p>Go into the places only locals are familiar with. Visit little known hideouts and avenues that open the mind into what being a local is all about.</p>		
			<figure><img width="1024" height="640" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle3.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle3.jpg 1024w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle3-600x375.jpg 600w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle3-300x188.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bicycle3-768x480.jpg 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure><h3>Enjoy professional equipment</h3><p>Go into the places only locals are familiar with. Visit little known hideouts and avenues that open the mind into what being a local is all about.</p>		
			<h4>Some of the companies that experienced our tours</h4>		
				<figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/x.venox_.png" alt="x.venox_.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/qum.png" alt="qum.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/mapmaster.png" alt="mapmaster.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/madrin.png" alt="madrin.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/darkside.png" alt="darkside.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/digit.png" alt="digit.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/bolier.png" alt="bolier.png" /></figure><figure><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/larozse.png" alt="larozse.png" /></figure>			
							"What I love about these tours is that the guides are not afraid to get off the beaten track and show us the real city. This is an I will definitely come back to"
							<img width="300" height="300" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25497478040_140ce47f31_k.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25497478040_140ce47f31_k.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25497478040_140ce47f31_k-100x100.jpg 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25497478040_140ce47f31_k-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25497478040_140ce47f31_k-90x90.jpg 90w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" />						
													Alene Elvine
																			HR Manager
							“The guide was everything I hoped for, and more. BikeTour really makes a difference, I would have never discovered the beautiful places we stopped for"
							<img width="291" height="291" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25388788904_72d2f5ec6f_z.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25388788904_72d2f5ec6f_z.jpg 291w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25388788904_72d2f5ec6f_z-100x100.jpg 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25388788904_72d2f5ec6f_z-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/25388788904_72d2f5ec6f_z-90x90.jpg 90w" sizes="(max-width: 291px) 100vw, 291px" />						
													Jonas Gerber
																			Designer
			<h3>Enjoy the bike ride of your life</h3>		
			<a href="#" role="button">
						Contact Us
					</a>]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
