		<content:encoded><![CDATA[		<img width="120" height="157" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2017/10/s-2.png" alt="" />		
			<h2>Coming soon</h2>		
		<p>A new line of luxury jewelery, built on the latest design trends, is about to hit stores in your area in a short while. We want everything to be just right, so we are putting the final touches as we speak.</p>		
					<ul>
							<li >
										888-505-999
									</li>
						</ul>
					<ul>
							<li >
										info@mail.com
									</li>
						</ul>
		]]></content:encoded>
