		<title><![CDATA[Contact Form 7]]></title>
		<link>http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/contact-form-7/</link>
		<pubDate>Sun, 05 Nov 2017 11:16:33 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[di-business]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/?page_id=791</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[
			<h1>Looking Forward</h1>		
			<h3>Find the home you always dreamed about</h3>		
			<h2>Contact</h2>		
