		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/?page_id=1031</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>SERVICES</h2>		
			<figure><img width="128" height="128" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/sketch1.png" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/sketch1.png 128w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/sketch1-90x90.png 90w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/sketch1-100x100.png 100w" sizes="(max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px" /></figure><h3>Planning</h3><p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>		
			<figure><img width="128" height="128" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/interior-design.png" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/interior-design.png 128w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/interior-design-90x90.png 90w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/interior-design-100x100.png 100w" sizes="(max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px" /></figure><h3>Interior</h3><p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>		
