		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>About us</h2>		
			<h2>Be Treated like Royalty!</h2>		
			<h2>Best in Industry</h2>		
			<h2>Why alexas’s Spa?</h2>		
											<a href="#" data-elementor-open-lightbox="">
							<img width="150" height="150" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/df-150x150.png" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/df-150x150.png 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/df-300x300.png 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/df-90x90.png 90w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/df-100x100.png 100w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/df.png 430w" sizes="(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px" />								</a>
			<h2><a href="#">Pure Natural Bliss</a></h2>		
			<h2>Do more of what makes you happy <br>and remember to take <br>care of yourself!</h2>		
											<a href="#" data-elementor-open-lightbox="">
							<img width="800" height="1199" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/dane-wetton-zdLdgGbi9Ow-unsplash.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/dane-wetton-zdLdgGbi9Ow-unsplash.jpg 800w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/dane-wetton-zdLdgGbi9Ow-unsplash-200x300.jpg 200w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/dane-wetton-zdLdgGbi9Ow-unsplash-768x1151.jpg 768w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/dane-wetton-zdLdgGbi9Ow-unsplash-683x1024.jpg 683w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/dane-wetton-zdLdgGbi9Ow-unsplash-600x899.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />								</a>
			<h2>01</h2>		
			<h2>Massage</h2>		
			<h2><a href="#">Do more of what makes you happy <br>and remember to take <br>care of yourself!</a></h2>		
											<a href="#" data-elementor-open-lightbox="">
							<img width="1024" height="768" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-business-wordpress-theme-demo-salon-spa-beach-spa.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-business-wordpress-theme-demo-salon-spa-beach-spa.jpg 1024w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-business-wordpress-theme-demo-salon-spa-beach-spa-300x225.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-business-wordpress-theme-demo-salon-spa-beach-spa-768x576.jpg 768w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-business-wordpress-theme-demo-salon-spa-beach-spa-600x450.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" />								</a>
			<h2>02</h2>		
			<h2>Thai Massage</h2>		
			<h2><a href="#">It organizes the energies of the body in alignment. Therapists work on the muscles, joints & body.</a></h2>		
											<a href="#" data-elementor-open-lightbox="">
							<img width="852" height="1280" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/massage-650879_1280.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/massage-650879_1280.jpg 852w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/massage-650879_1280-200x300.jpg 200w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/massage-650879_1280-768x1154.jpg 768w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/massage-650879_1280-682x1024.jpg 682w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/massage-650879_1280-600x901.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 852px) 100vw, 852px" />								</a>
			<h2>400</h2>		
			<h2>Clients</h2>		
			<h2>50</h2>		
			<h2> Therapists </h2>		
			<h2>75</h2>		
			<h2> Procedures </h2>		
			<h2>120</h2>		
			<h2>Treatments</h2>		
			<h2>Our Team</h2>		
			<h2>Come Get in touch with</h2>		
