		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>About us</h2>		
										<img width="570" height="184" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/about_1.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/about_1.jpg 570w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/about_1-300x97.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px" />											
			<h2>Our Story</h2>		
		Nam dapibus nisl vitae elit fringilla rutrum. Aenean sollicitudin, erat a elementum rutrum, neque sem pretium metus, quis mollis nisl nunc et massa. Nam dapibus nisl vitae elit fringilla rutrum. Aenean sollicitudin, erat a elementum rutrum, neque sem pretium metus, quis mollis nisl nunc et massa.
										<img width="570" height="184" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/about_2.png" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/about_2.png 570w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/about_2-300x97.png 300w" sizes="(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px" />											
			<h2>Our Mission</h2>		
		Nam dapibus nisl vitae elit fringilla rutrum. Aenean sollicitudin, erat a elementum rutrum, neque sem pretium metus, quis mollis nisl nunc et massa. Nam dapibus nisl vitae elit fringilla rutrum. Aenean sollicitudin, erat a elementum rutrum, neque sem pretium metus, quis mollis nisl nunc et massa.
