					<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Contact Page 1]]></title>
		<link>http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/contact-page-1/</link>
		<pubDate>Thu, 07 Nov 2019 05:00:34 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[di-business]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/?page_id=1063</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>Contact Us</h2>		
		<p>“I really enjoyed my stay. the staff were amazing. If excellent accomodations is what your looking for, choose this hotel.”</p>		
			<p><a href="#">Linda Richards</a></p>		
										<img width="614" height="572" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/concentric-circle-new-york.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/concentric-circle-new-york.jpg 614w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/concentric-circle-new-york-300x279.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/concentric-circle-new-york-600x559.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 614px) 100vw, 614px" />											
			<iframe frameborder="0" scrolling="no" marginheight="0" marginwidth="0" src="https://maps.google.com/maps?q=koh%20pi%20pi&amp;t=m&amp;z=15&amp;output=embed&amp;iwloc=near" aria-label="koh pi pi"></iframe>		
			<p>We would love to welcome you to our gorgeous resort in the breathtaking beach of Koh pi pi</p>		
					<ul>
							<li >
					<a href="#">						
										+ 81(0) 589 66 258
											</a>
									</li>
								<li >
					<a href="#">						
										+ 81(0) 589 66 566
											</a>
									</li>
								<li >
					<a href="#">						
										reservation@domain.com
											</a>
									</li>
						</ul>
			<h2>Enter Your Query</h2>		
		[contact-form-7 id="5" title="Contact form 1"]		
										<img width="900" height="900" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-business-theme-demo-contact-image.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-business-theme-demo-contact-image.jpg 900w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-business-theme-demo-contact-image-300x300.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-business-theme-demo-contact-image-150x150.jpg 150w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-business-theme-demo-contact-image-768x768.jpg 768w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-business-theme-demo-contact-image-90x90.jpg 90w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-business-theme-demo-contact-image-600x600.jpg 600w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-business-theme-demo-contact-image-100x100.jpg 100w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" />											
			<h2>This Way Under Construction</h2>]]></content:encoded>
		<excerpt:encoded><![CDATA[]]></excerpt:encoded>
