			<figure><a href="#"><img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-multipurpose/night-club/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/tuxedo.png" title="" alt="" /></a></figure><h3><a href="#">VIP SERVICE</a></h3><p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>		
			<h2>Club Live</h2>		
