					<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Construction]]></title>
		<link>http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/construction/</link>
		<pubDate>Tue, 12 Nov 2019 08:34:06 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[di-business]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/?page_id=1639</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>YOUR DREAM HOUSE</h2>		
		<p>Click edit button to change this text. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>		
			<a href="#" role="button">
						OUR SERVICES
					</a>
											<a href="#" data-elementor-open-lightbox="">
							<img width="600" height="300" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-construction-The-Effective-Teamwork.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-construction-The-Effective-Teamwork.jpg 600w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-construction-The-Effective-Teamwork-300x150.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px" />								</a>
			<h2><a href="#">The Effective Teamwork</a></h2>		
		As the general contractor, we first create the highest level of trust and integrity with our clients. We value our role in the success of your project.		
