					<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Event Planner]]></title>
		<link>http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/event-planner/</link>
		<pubDate>Tue, 12 Nov 2019 09:28:45 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[di-business]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/?page_id=1703</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>Let's have a party</h2>		
			<h2>We plan the <br>best events</h2>		
			<a href="#" role="button">
						Let Plan
					</a>
			<a href="#" role="button">
						Know More
					</a>
										<img width="853" height="1280" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-event-planner-theme-demo-about-1.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-event-planner-theme-demo-about-1.jpg 853w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-event-planner-theme-demo-about-1-200x300.jpg 200w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-event-planner-theme-demo-about-1-768x1152.jpg 768w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-event-planner-theme-demo-about-1-682x1024.jpg 682w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-event-planner-theme-demo-about-1-600x900.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 853px) 100vw, 853px" />											
			<h2>
Welcome to Grenda, a premier cater- ing and event planning company in New York, USA.
</h2>		
		<p>Apparently we had reached a great height in the atmosphere, for the sky was a dead black, and the stars had ceased to twinkle. By the same illusion which lifts the horizon of the sea to the level of the spectator on a hillside…</p>		
			<a href="#" role="button">
						READ FULL STORY
					</a>
			<h2>We’re The Largest Events Company</h2>		
		With our passion, knowledge, creative flair and inspiration,<br/> we are
dedicated in helping you to achieve.		
					<ul>
							<li >
										Checklist Development and Management.
									</li>
								<li >
										Budget Development and Tracking.
									</li>
								<li >
										Wedding Styling.
									</li>
								<li >
										Etiquette Consultation.
									</li>
								<li >
										Vendor Recommendations.
									</li>
								<li >
										Monthly Planning Meetings.
									</li>
								<li >
										Concierge Assistance.
									</li>
						</ul>
					<ul>
							<li >
										Hotel / conference venue management
									</li>
								<li >
										Exhibition management
									</li>
								<li >
										Venue finding
									</li>
								<li >
										Catering arrangements
									</li>
								<li >
										Photo,Video,Audio
									</li>
								<li >
										Assisting with rentals
									</li>
								<li >
										Managing your guest list
									</li>
						</ul>
										<img width="406" height="550" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/col-bg-005.png" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/col-bg-005.png 406w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/col-bg-005-221x300.png 221w" sizes="(max-width: 406px) 100vw, 406px" />											
			<h2>Hello there !</h2>		
			<h2>We’ll make your next <br/>celebration
very special!</h2>		
											<a href="#" data-elementor-open-lightbox="">
							<img width="640" height="426" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/birthday-947438_640.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/birthday-947438_640.jpg 640w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/birthday-947438_640-300x200.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/birthday-947438_640-600x399.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" />								</a>
			<h2><a href="#">Birthday</a></h2>		
											<a href="#" data-elementor-open-lightbox="">
							<img width="640" height="426" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/engagement-4129782_640.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/engagement-4129782_640.jpg 640w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/engagement-4129782_640-300x200.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/engagement-4129782_640-600x399.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" />								</a>
			<h2><a href="#">Engagements</a></h2>		
											<a href="#" data-elementor-open-lightbox="">
							<img width="640" height="426" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/people-2595862_640-2.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/people-2595862_640-2.jpg 640w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/people-2595862_640-2-300x200.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/people-2595862_640-2-600x399.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px" />								</a>
			<h2><a href="#">Wedding</a></h2>		
											<a href="#" data-elementor-open-lightbox="">
							<img src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/child-2936972_640-oglr8bteezyr9moxs42vp7b2ofc4vk208ygt2lfzng.jpg" title="child-2936972_640.jpg" alt="child-2936972_640.jpg" />								</a>
			<h2><a href="#">Corporate</a></h2>		
			<a href="#" role="button">
						View All
					</a>
			<h2>How it works</h2>		
			<h2>It’s simple. You have <br/> an event
to plan and we have the solutions</h2>		
				<h3>
					Find the perfect venue for free
				</h3>
			<a href="#" role="button">
						More Details
					</a>
				<h3>
					Connect with the best vendor
				</h3>
			<a href="#" role="button">
						More Details
					</a>
