		<title><![CDATA[Bakery]]></title>
		<link>http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/bakery/</link>
		<pubDate>Tue, 12 Nov 2019 10:41:32 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[di-business]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/?page_id=1817</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>CAKE AND COFFEE</h2>		
			<h2>Freshly baked bread and parties six time a day come and take or order </h2>		
			<a href="#" role="button">
						SEE ALL PRODUCTS
					</a>
			<h2>About us
</h2>		
										<img width="900" height="1350" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-dibusiness-wordpress-theme-demo-bakery.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-dibusiness-wordpress-theme-demo-bakery.jpg 900w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-dibusiness-wordpress-theme-demo-bakery-200x300.jpg 200w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-dibusiness-wordpress-theme-demo-bakery-768x1152.jpg 768w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-dibusiness-wordpress-theme-demo-bakery-683x1024.jpg 683w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-dibusiness-wordpress-theme-demo-bakery-600x900.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" />											
			<h2>Our Story</h2>		
		Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco labor is nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum.		
										<img width="800" height="533" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-dibusiness-wordpress-theme-demo-bakery-about.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-dibusiness-wordpress-theme-demo-bakery-about.jpg 800w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-dibusiness-wordpress-theme-demo-bakery-about-300x200.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-dibusiness-wordpress-theme-demo-bakery-about-768x512.jpg 768w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-dibusiness-wordpress-theme-demo-bakery-about-600x400.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" />											
			<a href="#" role="button">
						Readmore
					</a>
			<h2>Main Services We Provide</h2>		
Our services are the best in town, we provide great quality baked products
			<figure><img width="128" height="128" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/chef.png" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/chef.png 128w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/chef-90x90.png 90w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/chef-100x100.png 100w" sizes="(max-width: 128px) 100vw, 128px" /></figure><h3>Top Chefs</h3><p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.</p>		
