					<item>
		<title><![CDATA[Advertising Agency]]></title>
		<link>http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/advertising-agency/</link>
		<pubDate>Thu, 14 Nov 2019 05:30:42 +0000</pubDate>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[di-business]]></dc:creator>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/?page_id=1914</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>We Love Challenges!</h2>		
			<h2>Adverting</h2>		
		Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec <br/>ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.		
			<h2>About Us</h2>		
		Welcome to the About Us section of our agency website. This is where we’d usually tell you we care more about results then awards. Here agencies also usually brag about their unique station at the intersection of specialized expertise and a generalist approach and give themselves a ‘thumbs up’ for having a perfect blend of big agency resources and small agency nimbleness.https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XHOmBV4js_E		
			<h2>
Our Services
</h2>		
We provide a variety of marketing and promotion services to enable you and your business<br/> with innovative tools and strategies and attract more customers.
				<h3>
					Branding
				</h3>
								<p>Whether you’re looking to launch a brand or you just need help clarifying your message, we can help you.
</p>
				<h3>
					Strategy
				</h3>
								<p>Our experts can help you develop your marketing strategy and integrate it into your advertising campaign.
</p>
				<h3>
					 Video Production
				</h3>
								<p>Need a professional advertising video for your campaign?
We can offer anything you need.
</p>
				<h3>
					 Copywriting
				</h3>
								<p>Our experienced copywriters will gladly provide you with high-quality texts for your websites or advertisements.
</p>
				<h3>
					 SMM
				</h3>
								<p>We can develop a simple social media marketing plan designed specifically for your business and your needs.
</p>
				<h3>
					 Outdoor Advertising
				</h3>
								<p>If you need to create your next out-of-home campaign or lease your space, we can satisfy your advertising needs.​
</p>
				<h3>
					 Graphic Design
				</h3>
								<p>
Our graphic design services include printing brochures, banners and logos for your advertising campaign.
</p>
				<h3>
					 Marketing
				</h3>
								<p>
This service includes a variety of promotional techniques and methods that can boost your company’s products.
</p>
			<h2>
Advantages and Achievements
</h2>		
Our advertising agency has been leading the industry since our establishment 12 years ago.<br/> Our clients trust us with their marketing and promotional campaigns, and here’s why.
				<h3>
					22
				</h3>
								<p>International Awards</p>
				<h3>
					237
				</h3>
								<p>Successful Projects</p>
				<h3>
					12
				</h3>
								<p>Years of Experience</p>
				<h3>
					54
				</h3>
								<p>Qualified Employees</p>
										<img width="730" height="480" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-advertising-agency-part-1.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-advertising-agency-part-1.jpg 900w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-advertising-agency-part-1-300x197.jpg 300w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-advertising-agency-part-1-768x505.jpg 768w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/ditheme-advertising-agency-part-1-600x395.jpg 600w" sizes="(max-width: 730px) 100vw, 730px" />											
			<h2>iGadgets</h2>		
		Marketing Strategy Development		
