		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/?page_id=2038</guid>
		<description></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>HOOKAH BAR</h2>		
		Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur
adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec <br/>ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.		
			<h2>WELCOME TO DI THEME HOOKAH BAR &amp; LOUNGE</h2>		
		 Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.		
					<ul>
							<li >
										Hours of operations:<br/>2 PM to 3 AM daily
									</li>
								<li >
										Located: <br/>123 W 5Th St. Austin
									</li>
						</ul>
			<h2>Discover</h2>		
			<h3>TRADITION & QUALITY</h3>		
		Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.		
			<h2>ORIGINAL DRINKS</h2>		
			<h2>DELICIOUS FOOD</h2>		
			<h2>GREAT ATMOSPHERE</h2>		
			<h5>NIGHT OUT 01</h5>		
		<p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur <i>adipiscing </i>elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar <b>dapibus </b>leo.</p>		
			<h5>SMOKE AREA 03</h5>		
		Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Ut elit tellus, luctus nec ullamcorper mattis, pulvinar dapibus leo.		
										<img width="700" height="939" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/purepng.com-wine-bottleobjectswine-bottlebottle-min.png" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/purepng.com-wine-bottleobjectswine-bottlebottle-min.png 700w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/purepng.com-wine-bottleobjectswine-bottlebottle-min-224x300.png 224w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/purepng.com-wine-bottleobjectswine-bottlebottle-min-600x805.png 600w" sizes="(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px" />											
			<h5>02 MUSIC</h5>		
