		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h2>A place to Explore <br/> and Learn with Fun</h2>		
			<h2>a b c d e f g<br/> h i j k l m<br/> n o p q r s<br/> t u v w x y z</h2>		
			<h2>The ‘Little People’ Kindergarten </h2>		
										<img width="360" height="220" src="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/750x460_img6-360x220.jpg" alt="" srcset="http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/750x460_img6-360x220.jpg 360w, http://demo.dithemes.com/di-business/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/750x460_img6-360x220-300x183.jpg 300w" sizes="(max-width: 360px) 100vw, 360px" />											
			<h2>
Pre-School
</h2>		
		<p>Your child is growing up fast and ready for a little more independence, our pre school club will be a perfect introduction.</p>		
